# A road runs on past a street's last plot. A new street never runs over
# another road's end without a crossroads: it ends short of it instead.
new empty
free on
construction off
build crossroads at s0:40
ride #last
turn up
ride +30
build crossroads here
ride #last
turn up
ride +30
build crossroads here
# the third street runs south past the main street's west end, and stops short of it
streets
map L0:-C20

# A crossroads whose road would cross another road where it can't meet it
# (here: the rocks stop the new street, but its road's end would still run over
# the main street) can't be built.
new empty
free on
construction off
build crossroads at s0:79
build crossroads at s1:127
expect cannot build crossroads at s2:142 another road is too close
